<section class="process-section" id="process">
  <div class="process-inner">
    <div class="process-intro">
      <div>
        <span class="process-eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</span>

        <h2>
          Technically aligned <br />
          <span>before production starts.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        Clear inputs, controlled production and defined approval routes keep every package aligned
        from start to handoff.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-timeline">
      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="process-number">01</div>

        <div class="process-line"></div>

        <div class="process-content">
          <span>INPUTS</span>
          <h3>Confirm inputs, standards and responsibility matrix</h3>
          <p>
            Establish the source information, project standards, responsibilities and approval
            ownership before production begins.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="process-number">02</div>

        <div class="process-line"></div>

        <div class="process-content">
          <span>PRODUCTION</span>
          <h3>Produce against governed scope and change control</h3>
          <p>
            Work progresses against an agreed scope with structured revisions and controlled
            changes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="process-number">03</div>

        <div class="process-line"></div>

        <div class="process-content">
          <span>REVIEW</span>
          <h3>Return decisions to client-authorized approvers</h3>
          <p>
            Review points are routed back to the people responsible for design and project
            decisions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="process-number">04</div>

        <div class="process-line"></div>

        <div class="process-content">
